Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.82,0:41:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ахх...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.37,0:41:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Уф!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.33,0:41:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ах... Ах...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.29,0:41:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ах... у...
