Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.26,0:41:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ах! Хаха...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.35,0:42:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Хахахахахаха…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.60,0:42:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ах... Ах...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.10,0:42:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,(Найзағай)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.02,0:42:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ахх...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.90,0:42:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ах...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.03,0:42:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ах!
